sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker (EPP)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC TLS 1.2+
    participant ModelSrv as Model Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Sidecar as pd-sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Prefiller as Remote Prefiller<br/>8000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8001/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 1: Inference Request Routing (EPP)
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP
    Envoy->>EPP: ext-proc ProcessingRequest<br/>gRPC TLS 1.2+
    EPP->>ModelSrv: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP (insecureSkipVerify)
    ModelSrv-->>EPP: KV cache, queue depth,<br/>running requests
    Note over EPP: Filter → Score → Pick<br/>Select optimal endpoint
    EPP-->>Envoy: ext-proc ProcessingResponse<br/>Route to selected pod
    Envoy->>ModelSrv: Forward request<br/>HTTP/gRPC
    ModelSrv-->>Envoy: Inference result
    Envoy-->>Client: Response (streaming/unary)

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 2: P/D Disaggregation (NIXLv2 Serial)
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions
    Envoy->>Sidecar: Forward request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    Sidecar->>Prefiller: Prefill request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (configurable TLS)
    Note over Prefiller: Generate KV cache<br/>via RDMA transfer
    Prefiller-->>Sidecar: Prefill complete<br/>(KV metadata)
    Sidecar->>Decoder: Decode request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (configurable TLS)
    Note over Decoder: Decode using<br/>transferred KV cache
    Decoder-->>Sidecar: Token stream
    Sidecar-->>Client: SSE response stream<br/>HTTP/HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 3: E/P/D Disaggregation (with Encoder)
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(multimodal input)
    Envoy->>Sidecar: Forward request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    Sidecar->>Prefiller: Encode fanout<br/>(parallel to N encoders)
    Note over Prefiller: Encoder processes<br/>images/audio
    Prefiller-->>Sidecar: Encoded embeddings
    Sidecar->>Prefiller: Prefill with embeddings<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Prefiller-->>Sidecar: Prefill complete
    Sidecar->>Decoder: Decode request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Decoder-->>Sidecar: Token stream
    Sidecar-->>Client: SSE response stream
